  - Key: consent.intro
    English: A quick check before take-off!
    Vietnamese: "Ki\u1EC3m tra nhanh tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi c\u1EA5t c\xE1nh nh\xE9!"
  - Key: consent.local
    English: Your progress stays on this phone
    Vietnamese: "Ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u ngay tr\xEAn m\xE1y
      b\u1EA1n"
  - Key: consent.noAccount
    English: No account, name or email needed
    Vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n, t\xEAn hay email"
  - Key: consent.policy
    English: Privacy Policy
    Vietnamese: "Ch\xEDnh s\xE1ch quy\u1EC1n ri\xEAng t\u01B0"
  - Key: consent.agree
    English: I agree
    Vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ED3ng \xFD"
  - Key: loading.tip.wings
    English: Let me check the wings first...
    Vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EC3 B\u01A1 ki\u1EC3m tra c\xE1nh m\xE1y bay \u0111\xE3
      nha..."
  - Key: loading.tip.bags
    English: Are all the bags on board?
    Vietnamese: "H\xE0nh l\xFD l\xEAn khoang h\u1EBFt ch\u01B0a n\xE8?"
  - Key: loading.tip.belts
    English: Fasten your seatbelts, kitties!
    Vietnamese: "C\xE1c b\xE9 th\u1EAFt d\xE2y an to\xE0n nh\xE9!"
  - Key: loading.tip.snacks
    English: Did we pack enough fish snacks?
    Vietnamese: "C\xE1 kh\xF4 cho chuy\u1EBFn bay x\u1EBFp \u0111\u1EE7 ch\u01B0a?"
  - Key: loading.tip.tower
    English: Control tower, come in... meow?
    Vietnamese: "Al\xF4 \u0111\xE0i ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t... meo meo?"
  - Key: loading.tip.nap
    English: Someone wake up the co-pilot!
    Vietnamese: "Ai \u0111\xE1nh th\u1EE9c c\u01A1 ph\xF3 d\u1EADy gi\xF9m B\u01A1
      v\u1EDBi!"
  - Key: loading.tip.yarn
    English: Hey, come back here, yarn!
    Vietnamese: "\u01A0 k\xECa, cu\u1ED9n len l\u0103n \u0111i \u0111\xE2u r\u1ED3i!"
  - Key: loading.tip.window
    English: No fighting over the window seat!
    Vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng gi\xE0nh gh\u1EBF c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 n\u1EEFa m\u1EA5y
      \u0111\u1EE9a!"
