    English: Flight {0}
    Vietnamese: "Chuy\u1EBFn {0}"
  - Key: gameplay.specialLevel
    English: "Flight {0} \xB7 {1}"
    Vietnamese: "Chuy\u1EBFn {0} \xB7 {1}"
  - Key: rule.runway.title
    English: Runway
    Vietnamese: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng b\u0103ng"
  - Key: rule.runway.body
    English: 'Land on the runway: the flight has to end on this square, so plan your
      route to finish here.'
    Vietnamese: "H\u1EA1 c\xE1nh \u1EDF \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng b\u0103ng: chuy\u1EBFn
      bay ph\u1EA3i k\u1EBFt th\xFAc t\u1EA1i \xF4 n\xE0y, h\xE3y t\xEDnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      \u0111\u1EC3 v\u1EC1 \u0111\xEDch \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y."
  - Key: rule.night.title
    English: Night flight
    Vietnamese: "Bay \u0111\xEAm"
  - Key: rule.night.body
    English: Watch the route once, then fly it in the dark. Only your plane's lights
      show the way.
    Vietnamese: "Nh\u1EDB k\u1EF9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng bay \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EC9
      m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n, r\u1ED3i bay trong \u0111\xEAm. Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 \u0111\xE8n
      m\xE1y bay soi \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng."
  - Key: rule.formation.title
    English: Formation
    Vietnamese: "Bay \u0111\u1ED9i h\xECnh"
  - Key: rule.formation.body
    English: Two planes fly as mirror images. Cover your half and your wingman covers
      the other.
    Vietnamese: "Hai m\xE1y bay bay \u0111\u1ED1i x\u1EE9ng nh\u01B0 soi g\u01B0\u01A1ng.
      Ph\u1EE7 k\xEDn n\u1EEDa c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, m\xE1y bay \u0111\u1ED3ng \u0111\u1ED9i
      s\u1EBD ph\u1EE7 n\u1EEDa c\xF2n l\u1EA1i."
  - Key: rule.vip.title
    English: VIP flight
    Vietnamese: "Chuy\u1EBFn bay VIP"
  - Key: rule.vip.body
    English: A chapter's last flight mixes the rules you know. Land it for a gold
      seal on the stamp and a VIP guest in the lounge!
    Vietnamese: "Chuy\u1EBFn cu\u1ED1i ch\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p c\xE1c
      lu\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc. Ho\xE0n th\xE0nh \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn d\u1EA5u
      v\xE0ng tr\xEAn tem v\xE0 m\u1ED9t v\u1ECB kh\xE1ch VIP gh\xE9 ph\xF2ng ch\u1EDD!"
  - Key: special.vip
    English: VIP
    Vietnamese: VIP
  - Key: rule.wind.title
    English: Wind
    Vietnamese: "Lu\u1ED3ng gi\xF3"
  - Key: rule.wind.body
    English: Fly onto a windy square and the gust pushes you on the way its arrow
      points.
    Vietnamese: "Bay v\xE0o \xF4 c\xF3 gi\xF3, m\xE1y bay s\u1EBD b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EA9y
      \u0111i ti\u1EBFp theo \u0111\xFAng h\u01B0\u1EDBng m\u0169i t\xEAn."
  - Key: rule.gotIt
    English: Got it!
    Vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 hi\u1EC3u!"
